window.products.push({"id":490037,"name":"AITEE Acrylic Under Cabinet Coffee Pod Holder for K Cups, White K Cup Coffee Pod Holder, Space-Saving Under Counter Cabinet Coffee Pod Holder for 12 K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iMsZG55uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Coffee Pod Holder With a Capacity of 12 K Cup Capsules】This under cabinet coffee pod holder for K cups can holds 12 K-cup coffee capsules and measures 13.1x5.1 inches. The design is simple and beautiful, the K cup capsules can be arranged in the K cup holder neatly and orderly, and it is not easy to slip off. Keep the K cup neatly organized, easy to take and look beautiful. 【Damping Design & Not Easy to Sag】This K cup holder is designed with damping, you can freely adjust the angle to use according to your preference. The damping design has a strong load-bearing capacity, and there will be no sagging of the shelf. Fixation is very good. You can freely retract the K cup holder when you are using it, pull it out when you are using it, and retract it under the cabinet when not in use. This is very space saving. 【Save Counter Space】This K cup holder can effectively save the space on the counter table, organize and store our K cup capsules, this design hidden under the cabinet is very space-saving, and it is convenient to take the K cup.We have designed 12 holes, each hole corresponds to one K cup capsule, you can clearly see the taste of the K cup capsule. 【Made of Clear Unique Acrylic】The AITEE K cup coffee pod organizer tray is made of acrylic material with high transparency, so we can clearly see the capsules or coffee pods placed. And this material is very strong and not fragile. Suitable for any style of decoration. Finally, the coffee pod holder is easy to clean, if there is water stains, you can wipe it with a cloth. 【Easy to Clean and Install】This coffee pod organizer is easy to clean. When stained, wipe with a soft, clean damp cloth. This acrylic material is strong and durable. After receiving it, you can directly refer to the manual to install, which is very simple.Transparent K cup coffee pod holder can be used in offices, counters, and kitchens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iMsZG55uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AITEE","source_asin":"B0B5ZN25N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5ZN25N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5ZN25N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":490038,"name":"Vanyear Crochet Doily Tablecloths Crochet Square Table Cover Lace Table Covering Doilies for Furniture Décor 11.8inch by 19.6inch Oval Table Doilies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t7rCZS5hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Includes: 1 piece suqare durable cloth placemats/coasters;Diameter/Coaster Width: 11.8inch by 19.6inch (30 x 50cm);Ideal for dressing up your serving tray.A fabric coaster should protect your surfaces from expensive damage, which is exactly what our table cloth does.To Our Best Buyers: We strive to provide the best customer service we can, If you do have any problem with your order or item , please feel free to contact with us and let us how we are doing Return Policy : In most cases, customers can request to return an item within 30 days of receiving it.Refund Policy: Full Refund will be issued if you 1. Return the item;2. Got the item damaged;3. Not get the item during Estimated Delivery Time Customer Service: All your message or Request will be replied in 12hours  Feature : 1.Although it is hollow out design, the excellent quality ensure that it is very durable. 2. Easy Set Up - Great festive ornamnents for holiday feasts, family get togethers and other banquets 3. This handmade table cloth can be used as and more. Fashion and unique design adds romantic feeling with rural style to your home. 4. Delicate tablecloth is made by hand shabby and chic tablecloth. Wonderful artical excelling nature, pure and modern. Tips for you : *Dimensions may vary slightly within 8 % due to hand crochet process.It has extended space, so you can buy a bigger one than the normal size.*Washed by hand gently or can be wash by machine,do not soak it too long,or use hot water,had better not machine wash,hung in ventilated place dry,anti-exposure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71t7rCZS5hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vanyear","source_asin":"B07MLJ73TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MLJ73TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MLJ73TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
