window.products.push({"id":490171,"name":"Balacho Modern Soft Shaggy Rugs Fluffy Living Room Carpet 4x6 Feet Navy Blue,Shag Fuzzy Area Rug for Bedroom,Baby Nursery Dorm Plush Rug Decor,Kids An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ki91A0V+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft Touch: Balacho fluffy area rug pays attention to the quality assurance of every tuft and side. Combined modern tufting technology with traditional craftsmanship to create 0.3'' memory foam interlayer and 1.57'' long pile plush carpet. Each tuft of evenly colored and thicken encryption fluff brings silky touch of cloud-like foot feel Intimate Detail Design:Our shaggy Carpets rugs bottom features thousands of silicone non-slip dots,Which can effectively moisture-proof and anti-skid then protect the floor. The sound-absorbing and high-elastic sponge interlayer provides intimate cushioning for family. The firm edging design can prevent the soft fuzzy carpet from falling off. Enduring Aesthetic Perception: Balacho is loyal to create Shaggy Throw Rug centered on popular aesthetics. Use our plush throw carpet to instead redundant elements of bedroom and living room. Solid colour design is simple and elegant,suitable for any room and home decor.Perfect gift for your baby and family any occasion.Perfect gift for your baby and family any occasion Romantic Mood of Life: In your free days, sitting on the indoor shag rug to watch a movie with your family and drink coffee will add sentiment to your life. In the days of home office and study, sitting on the fluffy bedroom rug and doing laptop activities, it will provide you with a comfortable and quiet space for thinking. It is a romantic decorative element for bedroom, living room, college dorm,classroom,playroom,etc. Simple Way To Clean: We recommend vacuuming the soft fluffy rug regularly to reduce potential shedding and dust. Use a low-power vacuum cleaner or wipe it with a damp cloth locally. If you use washing machine, please put it in a laundry bag or choose the low power grade. It is suggested to let it dry naturally in a ventilated place, and the use of drying machine is not allowed.Note:To avoiding dirt in the freight,our plush rugs is packed in vacuum bag, due to vacuum compression packaging, please lay shag rug flat after taking it out, the thickness,size and some creases will recover after 2-3 days,please don't worry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ki91A0V+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Balacho","source_asin":"B09D7FS816","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7FS816","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7FS816","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
