window.products.push({"id":490235,"name":"Polish Pottery Bubble Mug 16 oz Mosquito","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71liPjcGfmL._AC_SL1216_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Bubble Mug 16 oz Mosquito Dimensions: 4\" wide, 5½\" long, 4\" high Capacity: 16oz Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71liPjcGfmL._AC_SL1216_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B00BAWJ0QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BAWJ0QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BAWJ0QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":490236,"name":"Enhance the Style of Your Fireplace with a Condar Mesh Screen. Fireplace Mesh Screen Curtain. 25\" High. Includes 2 Panels, each 24\" Wide.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MZUZu7XYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enhance the style of your fireplace with a Condar mesh screen. Condar’s attractive fireplace mesh screens make your fireplace the center piece of any room. Functional, visually appealing, and made to last. All Condar screen packages include: Two panels, totaling 48 inches wide.19 gauge steel mesh.1/4 inch openings in the mesh.1/2 inch hanger rings.Matte black finish.A pair of matching Cool Grip screen pulls.All screen packages include two panels, totaling 48 inches wide. This is sufficient for an attractive natural drape effect on most fireplaces and inserts. Standard screen sizes range from 16 inches through 36 inches tall.How to choose the right size screen for your fireplace:Just measure the height and width of your current screen (not including hanger rings) and order the same height screen. Condar's hanger rings will add half inch (1 cm) to total height.Buying a screen and already have a rod installed? If you already have a rod installed, measure the height of your fireplace opening to the top of the rod. Subtract ½ inch (1 cm) for the hanger rings below the rod, and approximately ½ inch (1 cm) for clearance at the bottom (1 inch: 3 cm total). Condar fireplace screens do not include a rod.If you don’t have a fireplace screen rod installed, choose the Rod and Valance Kit (ASIN: B0039ZD9O2). IMPORTANT: When ordering both Rod and Valance Kit and screen choose a screen size 2 inches (5 cm) shorter than the height of your fireplace opening (this accounts for hanger rings and clearance at the bottom).Now available in Stainless Steel (Amazon ASIN: B01NC3EV8K).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MZUZu7XYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Condar","source_asin":"B000HPXEOM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HPXEOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HPXEOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
