window.products.push({"id":490332,"name":"WestonBasics 6 Pcs Mesh Laundry Bags for Delicates with Cute Prints, Travel Storage Organizer Pack, Garment Washing Bags for Clothes, Bras, Underwear,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717rZ9VWW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a way to protect your laundry items from damage? Tired of finding stretched straps and damaged hooks after a laundry cycle? You may also lose socks and get your bras all tangled up. Most people turn to handwashing to prevent these laundry mishaps. Wouldn’t it be great if you could find an alternative that is not as tiresome and time-consuming? The WestonBasics Mesh Laundry Bags let you wash delicate fabrics in the washing machine without causing damage. Made of soft polyester fabric, our set of 6 laundry bags shield delicate articles of clothing from damage. Preventing different types of fabrics from rubbing against each other, these pouches ward off wear and tear. They also keep laundry pieces organized, allowing you to avoid missing socks and underwear. Our laundry bags come in 6 different shapes and sizes that are suitable for common laundry items. Our bags can be used to protect your underwear, bra, stockings, hosiery, lingerie, socks, blouses, tank tops, coats, and sweaters. These wash bags also have cool colors and prints that bring fun to laundry time. They make great gifts for special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, and Mother's Day. Aside from laundry, these pouches can be used as extra storage bags and travel organizers in your suitcase. Sorting out your travel items will be a breeze. Plus, the see-through material makes TSA checks faster and easier. Here are more reasons to love our laundry bags: ✅ Extremely durable ✅ Fade resistant ✅ Reusable and eco-conscious Choose an easy way to protect your laundry from damage. Add the WestonBasics Mesh Laundry Bags to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717rZ9VWW6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WestonBasics","source_asin":"B08D8Q7HMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D8Q7HMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D8Q7HMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
