window.products.push({"id":490462,"name":"South Shore Savannah Daybed with Storage, Twin, Pure White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":469.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613WJt7l0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Doubles as a bed and a sofa This piece is much more than just a bed – they can sleep on it at Night and use it as a sofa during the day. Kids love it because they can sit on it comfortably to read or play games. It’s also very handy when they have friends over – place it against the wall in your guest room, so it takes up less space, and you can use it as a sofa when you don't have overnight guests. Storage under the bed The Savannah Daybed features three small storage drawers hidden underneath. You can use it for clothes, games, or sheets. The drawers have metal slides, which are sturdier and easier to move back and forth. Cottage style The Savannah collection is timeless and elegant. All of the pieces are designed in the cottage style, which will last through the years, and feature attractive decorative moldings and round wooden handles. 5-Year limited South Shore is proud to stand behind this Daybed with 3 storage drawers with an exclusive 5-year limited. Shop with confidence knowing your purchase is always covered. South Shore beds can support a weight capacity of 250 lb. For a Twin size bed and 500 lb. For a full, queen and King size bed. All our products meets or exceeds North American safety standards and our packaging are tested and certified to reduce the risk of damage during shipment. This item is shipped in 2 boxes, make sure to have a friend with you. Assembly is required by 2 adults and tools are not included. If you have questions regarding this product or need assistance do not hesitate to Contact South Shore furniture 7 days support. This product is made in North America with laminated particleboard. Mattress and accessories not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613WJt7l0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B07G852Y3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G852Y3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G852Y3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
