window.products.push({"id":490547,"name":"Izola Oval Compact Petit Stainless Steel Travel Flask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yjWd6Q4SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Living in New York City, there are countless moments when a stiff drink may be necessary. Whether you’re stuck on a broken down A Train or shuffling your way around an overcrowded rooftop party, a flask can be a lifesaver and is always a good conversation starter. Skip the bottles and cups and make the smart decision. Izola’s stainless steel flasks are available in either five-ounces or three-ounces and are engraved with eight different boisterous expressions that fit the drinking theme. As a time-honored accessory to men and women of all different cultures and social classes, the flask has proven itself to be a necessity of the times and we guarantee it’s an awesome gift that fits any occasion. Salut!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yjWd6Q4SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Izola","source_asin":"B07CH8QGFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CH8QGFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CH8QGFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":490548,"name":"4-Piece Measuring Cups Set, (1/4 cup, 1/3 cup, 1/2 cup and 1 cup) Stainless Steel Baking Cups for Dry and Liquid Ingredients by Tezzorio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616AjKhAWOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A must-have kit for any household, this wonderful 4 pc set includes cups of following sizes: 1/4 cup (60 ml), 1/3 cup (80 ml), 1/2 cup (120 ml) and 1 cup (240 ml).  Measurements are imprinted on to each cup handle which means that it will not rub off, even after heavy use. Crafted from food-grade, 18/8 stainless steel, they can be used in the oven, microwave, fridge, or freezer allowing complete flexibility. All 4 cups designed to nest, with a stainless steel ring that can be removed, if necessary - perfect for small kitchens or where there is limited storage. This utensil is a kitchen must-have, and an absolute steal at this price. Easy to clean with detergent and water, and also completely dishwasher safe. Why food-grade stainless steel? Aluminum is much softer than stainless steel, so can dent, ding or scratch easily. Cheap plastic imitations absorb odor, and can easily stain and warp over time. Premium, 18/8 food-grade stainless steel is the only material designed to be extremely durable, safe to use, and built to last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616AjKhAWOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B07492HSLN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07492HSLN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07492HSLN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
