window.products.push({"id":490568,"name":"U-Taste 1.5oz Angled Turkey Baster - 228.2℉ Heat Resistant Food Grade Tritan and Silicone Large Octopus Bulb Baster Set with Cleaning Brush for Cookin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512HtsMgBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Not just make it, we upgrade it!] We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focused on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. [Heat Resistant Silicone and Tritan] U-Taste turkey baster is built to withstand hot juice. No melting issues. The cute octopus bulb is made of 600℉ heat resistant silicone and BPA free food grade tritan body (Tritan is a temperature-resistant PCTG with a temperature resistance of -4~228.2℉). The clear-like-crystal texture lets you know what you are basting the food with. You can use it to baste turkey or ham, or to extract fat from baking meatloaf, or to remove the grease from hamburger meat. [Built-In Stand and Drip-Proof Curved Tube] Since it is hard to baste a turkey thoroughly in 1 trip, and is not every time you can have a spoon holder right within touch, the built-in foot should be a bonus to you. The little stand helps to keep the tube stay in place on the counter, instead of rolling around and messing up your cooktop. And slightly curved tip will keep “up” not touching the surface when set down and the liquid can be hold back in the tube to prevent leaking and dripping. [Slanted Tip and Integrated Construction] A turkey baster for cooking with a slanted tip can do you a lot of favors. Though the tube is hard and thick, a curve tip helps to cover the most hard-to-reach places even under the turkey. When set down, the angled neck keeps the tip up from the counter, which prevents leakage. It takes efforts to make tube and tip in a whole, but we did it. Cracks, leaking, hard-to-clean joint place? Integrated construction fixes these problems once for all. [Dishwasher Safe and Attached Cleaning Brush] The cute octopus shape bulb is not just for a decoration purpose, but also a representative of its suction ability. A press on its bulb, you can see how much liquid drawn into the tube by checking the engraved ML and OZ measurements. It can go right in the dishwasher and still come out good. Enclosed a long (22cm/8.66in) cleaning brush helps to clean thoroughly if you decide to hand wash it and the smooth tip on the top will not scrape your baster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512HtsMgBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B09LS5JVDX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LS5JVDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LS5JVDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":490569,"name":"Knitted Argyle & Skulls Right Oven Mitt & Pot Holder Set w/Monogram","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8193nsBJImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replace your ordinary, worn oven mitts and pot holders with our one-of-a-kind, customizable ones! Our oven mitts, when coupled with our pot holders make for wonderful additions to your kitchen's decor and serve as wonderful housewarming gifts for family and friends!Our oven mitt gloves are made from a durable neoprene and feature a textured, rubberized surface on the palm's side for an easy grip. A strong stitch connects the neoprene and rubber, increasing the durability of this mitt. These oven gloves are spacious, and can accommodate both small and large hands. A thin, black loop is attached to the mitt's top, which can be used to hang and store the mitt. Your customization is displayed across the entire front of the neoprene surface. We sell both left and right hand models of these, separately.Along with our heat resistant gloves, we also carry personalized pot holders. These pot holders also feature a neoprene front that displays your personalization, and a textured, rubber backing for a sturdy grip. The two materials are connected with a sleek, black trim, and the hot pot holder also includes an attached loop for hanging and storage. You can purchase a kitchen pot holder by itself, or alongside a right or left oven mitt, depending on your needs. The pot holder itself is approximately 8.75 inches by 8.75 inches and 0.25 inches tall.Both your custom pot holders and kitchen mittens can be cleaned in your washing machine. We suggest placing the mitts and holders in cold water with gentle detergent, and setting to a delicate cycle. Afterwards, please hang them to allow for proper air drying.Design Shown: Knitted Argyle & Skulls (#271505)Features:==================================== * Holder and mitt made of neoprene front and textured, rubber, backing * Mitt has a heavy-duty stitch between materials * Holder features a sleek, black trim * Both have attached loops for easy storage * Set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8193nsBJImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YouCustomizeIt","source_asin":"B00WTI3UE4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WTI3UE4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WTI3UE4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":490570,"name":"2 Pcs Artificial Greenery Garland Wedding Garland Eucalyptus Garland Fake Hanging Green Willow Eucalyptus Leaves Vine Table Runner Jungle Party Backdr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qt2Kw2pCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Wedding Greenery Plant: Our package includes 2 separate Greenery Garlands,you have to twine them together by yourself.Hanging seeded eucalyptus garland and Hanging Willow Vines Twigs Leaves Garland feature realistic appearance,made from silk leaves and plastic seeds that will not wilt or fade and you also don't worry about little bugs crawling out onto your table. Decorate with the Eucalyptus Leaves Garland and Willow Leaves Garland: Place them on the welcome sign, arbor, or draped from chair to chair,decorate as a centerpieces in sweets table, the gift table, the name card table,and anywhere you want to create a comforting atmosphere.You can even use it to decorate dmantels, banisters, head tables,banquet tables, window ledges,fence posts, church pews,table runner,centerpiece display,arches, poles, backdrops,walls,doorways,photo booths,and more!T Eucalyptus Garland for Holiday Christmas Decoration - Use for Holiday Table Runner: - Christmas Eucalyptus Wreath: Combine the eucalyptus garland with other seasonal plants, like poinsettia flowers, holly, pine, berries, to make a beautiful holiday wreath. Eucalyptus Garland for Wedding Decoration - Make A Eucalyptus Wreath or Candle Ring: Loop the eucalyptus garland to a eucalyptus wreath for decorating the front door, or candle ring for a table centerpiece. - Over A Wedding Sign: Arrange a eucalyptus garland around your wedding sign for an added touch of sophistication and elegance. - On A Cake Table: Combine eucalyptus garland with flowers that match the decor on your wedding cake for a cohesive look that will be sure to impress. - As A Table Runner: A eucalyptus garland table runner is a great alternative to large centerpieces, because they have a low profile which will allow your guests to interact from across the table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qt2Kw2pCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B081SXDWM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081SXDWM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081SXDWM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
