window.products.push({"id":490638,"name":"Giantex 2000 Watt Meat Grinder Electric 2.6 Hp Home Industrial Meat Grinder Sausage Maker Stuffer 3 Speed W/1 Stainless Steel Cutting Blade, 3 Cutting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+oDOphAWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥩〖Powerful Motor & Quick Meat Grinding〗: This electric meat grinder has 2000W max power, which means the electric meat grinder works effectively meeting most of the home grinding needs. Furthermore, it is a perfect choice for a supermarket. Prepare your food easier, and free your hands. 🥩〖Complete Accessories for Various Food processing〗: Our electric meat grinder is equipped with three different cutting accessories for coarse, medium and fine grinds of meat. The package includes sausage stuffing funnel and kibbe attachments for quickly stuffing sausage and making kibbes. This meat grinder can grind not only meat but also other foods like chicken, carrots, mushrooms and so on. 🥩〖Simple & Safe Operation〗: The grinder can be used easily by placing the cutting blade and cutting plate in it. Four key switches to Stop & Reset/On/Half/Reverse make it clear to operate. Attentive design of the Reverse Key keeps the motor from burning out when meat is stuck in the tube. With the help of the food pusher, your fingers are safe. 🥩〖Durable & Stainless Steel〗: The main body of the electric meat grinder is made of ABS food grade plastic material to ensure the safety of the food. The big tray is made of aluminum alloy to hold large pieces of meat. The grinder head is made of polished stainless steel making it very sturdy and durable. 🥩〖Convenient to Store & Easy to Clean〗: There is one storage on the top for attachment and second storage on the back for the power cord. Both of them are for convenient collection. This meat grinder is also very easy to clean, just wash the cutting blade with running water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+oDOphAWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B00OYADXD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OYADXD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OYADXD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
