window.products.push({"id":490698,"name":"COCOPLOCEUS Set of 2 Boho Pillow Covers 24x24 Decorative Farmhouse Pillow Covers Velvet Square Cushion Covers Soft Bubble Texture Euro Shams for Couch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c8HD1HH4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Soft Premium Material - The euro sham pillow covers are made of velvet, the filling is made of hypoallergenic polyester fiber.The special bubble quilting process makes the pillowcase very elastic and can be used for 24 and 26 inch pillow insert ✅ Delicate Craftsmanship - Smooth hidden zipper design,seamless to make the 24 inch pillow case look beautiful and unique.The texture of the bubble makes the euro shams as soft as clouds or marshmallows, with an excellent feel. Elegant design for various styles of home decoration. ✅ Thick Feel Design - Advanced euro pillow covers have 5 layers of material, respectively: shell,linings,back,filling,filling fixed layer.Compared with the general market covers to 3 more layers of material,focusing on the comfort of use. Thick fabric can make these cushion covers to maintain a good shape.Can also be used directly as a cushion ✅ Fashion Decoration - Versatile colors perfect for living room, bedroom, couch, sofa, car, party, office.Both indoor and outdoor can be used.Can be used for gift or personal use, suitable as a new home gift, all kinds of holiday gifts to your neighbors and friends. ✅ What You Can Get - Set of 2 24x24 pillow covers；Note : 1. Color may be different in different light or on different screen. 2. We recommend hand washing in cool water using liquid detergent. No soaking. No bleach.In case of using washing machine, set up a Delicate Washing Mode (80-100ºF degrees) with mild detergent and air dry it. ⭐About the color difference -- ①The color will be different under different monitors. ② Under different brightness of light, 24x24 pillow covers color will also have light and dark changes.The color will be lighter in cooler tones,in the warm light will have a little yellow tone, but not too different from the original color 💡 Vacuum packaging -- The pillow covers will be slightly creased after being compressed, it will return to its original state after a period of use, no need to worry about the feeling of use. If you need to quickly restore the original state, you can first wash or ironing 👉Because the surface of the velvet material has short fluff, there may be a little reflection in the light, so the color of some pictures will be more lighter 👉Already washed in advance, open and ready to use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c8HD1HH4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COCOPLOCEUS","source_asin":"B0C16QCPHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C16QCPHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C16QCPHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
