window.products.push({"id":490955,"name":"Riedel Ayam Rosa Decanter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":599.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C0sSAL89L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ayam decanter is inspired by and named after the rare breed of Indonesian hen, and makes a unique centerpiece for the table in the form of a high-functioning instrument for wine enjoyment. Formed freely by hand, the decanter features a wide mouth for both receiving and pouring wine, opening into a wider base to allow the free flow of air exchange with the wine. A tapered and curled tip adds a second level of functionality to the Ayam, acting as an elegant handle. This piece features a wash of rose pink through the design, achieved by introducing a rod of pink crystal into the molten glass before the decanter has been formed. This decanter is designed to hold either a single or magnum bottle of wine. This pack contains a single piece. This product is handmade. Please handwash only. The RIEDEL Bottle Cleaner cannot be used with this product as they can become lodged and unable to remove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C0sSAL89L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B08X9XRV44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X9XRV44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X9XRV44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":490956,"name":"Happy Retirement Fanci-Fetti (multi-color) Party Accessory  (1 count) (.5 Oz/Pkg)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.63,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718HV-plJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*** Beistle Happy Retirement fanci-fetti *** This Multicolor confetti is great to use for a retirement party. There is a half Ounce of confetti in the package. *** Party Planning Made Fun ***From New Year’s Eve Parties, Halloween and Fall Festivities, Bachelorette Parties, Birthday Bashes, Graduation Get-Togethers, Baby Showers, Pool Parties, and more, our Novelty Items and Party Supplies are sure to add a pop of color and extra spice to any occasion.*** Celebrating life's events - one party at a time ***The Beistle line includes over 8,000 items - products for nearly any event, celebration, or theme imaginable. Since 1900 our mission has remained the same: Create products using the finest materials and to the highest standards. Our customers, products, and employees make us who we are. We are The Beistle Company!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718HV-plJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beistle","source_asin":"B000R4OLEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-490956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000R4OLEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000R4OLEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
